gy-planner-executor.ts, lines 99-200 hold the lane and argument constants; AgyPlannerExecutor is at lines 659-1411, and its start method is at line 771, not at lines 17-70, which are the module comment. Correct each citation or remove its line numbers.\n5. README.md line 118 says merging defines a migration without applying it to any database and that the README makes no claim about production Neon; it says nothing about a custody receipt. The bullet list under the PR 2b paragraph (line 115) ends at line 143 with the Not done bullet; the custody receipt at line 142 does not end it. Correct both.\nChange nothing the feedback does not name; copy every hash and path from the earlier plan exactly.\nBefore returning the plan, check every name, line number and claim about behaviour against the files you read, and remove any you did not see.","occurredAt":"2026-11-12T04:11:29.476Z","attribution":{"roleId":null,"actorId":"founder","actualModel":"n/a (human Founder decision)","executionSurface":"founder-terminal"}},"committed_at":"2026-11-12T04:11:29.460Z"},{"seq":"5","event_id":"evt_f6a75c50-14b9-41bd-b170-59c09ca10e67","event":"plan.submitted","outcome":"transition","entry_seq":5,"transition_id":"T3","guard_id":"G3","from_state":"PLANNING","resulting_state":"PLAN_REVIEW","actor":"agent.planner","attribution":{"roleId":"architect","actorId":"gateway:1880c12d-d98d-4a91-b25a-23320aa7f58a","actualModel":"gemini-4-argon","executionSurface":"antigravity"},"scope":{"repo":"MADVenturesLLC/founder-os-build-room","paths":["README.md"],"roomId":"fcca38f3-38e1-4ff7-8cfd-a185be1d4175"},"evidence":[{"ref":"cmd_planner_f79d3dcd3c5db2fd97005e00bdfa5008","kind":"plandoc","digest":"1952499eef0425e8a4064a853cbdb875668b497bf6005334023bbc124688caa8"}],"overlays":[],"round":0,"occurred_at":"2026-11-12T04:15:49.901Z","payload":{"actor":"agent.planner","event":"plan.submitted","facts":{"planHash":"1952499eef0425e8a4064a853cbdb875668b497bf6005334023bbc124688caa8","gatewayOnline":true,"planDocSchem